### Architecture overview

```text
                    CUSTOMER
                       |
                       v
              www.saucyculture.in
                       |
                       v
                    VERCEL
                       |
              Next.js Application
                       |
             +---------+---------+
             |                   |
             v                   v
         Storefront          API Routes
             |                   |
             |          +--------+--------+
             |          |        |        |
             v          v        v        v
         Products     Products  Orders  Circle
                         API      API     API
                                  |
                                  v
                              Prisma ORM
                                  |
                                  v
                           PRISMA POSTGRES
