# 6. Database Architecture

## Database provider

The original local development setup used SQLite.

During deployment, the project was migrated to PostgreSQL using Prisma Postgres.

Current production configuration:

```prisma
datasource db {
  provider  = "postgresql"
  url       = env("DATABASE_URL_POOLED")
  directUrl = env("DATABASE_URL")
}
```

Important distinction:

- `DATABASE_URL_POOLED`: Used for normal application database connections.
- `DATABASE_URL`: Direct database connection, used by Prisma CLI for schema operations.

The database is hosted independently of the Vercel application.

## Database models

Currently, there are three main database models.

### Product

Stores the product catalogue.

| Field | Type | Purpose |
|---|---|---|
| id | Int | Primary key |
| slug | String | Unique product identifier |
| name | String | Product name |
| category | String | Product category |
| collection | String | Collection name |
| price | Int | Selling price in INR |
| compareAt | Int | Original/comparison price |
| badge | String | Promotional product label |
| spec | String | Product specifications |
| svgType | String | SVG illustration identifier |
| stock | Int | Stock quantity |
| createdAt | DateTime | Creation timestamp |

The stock field defaults to 50.

### Order

Stores customer order information.

| Field | Type | Purpose |
|---|---|---|
| id | String | Primary key |
| orderNumber | String | Unique order reference |
| customerName | String | Customer name |
| customerPhone | String | Contact number |
| shippingAddr | String | Delivery address |
| itemsJson | String | Purchased items stored as JSON |
| totalINR | Int | Total order value |
| paymentStatus | String | Order/payment status |
| createdAt | DateTime | Order timestamp |

Default payment status:

```text
PAYMENT_ON_HOLD
```

### CircleMember

Stores VIP community registrations.

| Field | Type | Purpose |
|---|---|---|
| id | String | Primary key |
| nickname | String | Customer nickname |
| whatsappPhone | String | Unique WhatsApp number |
| preferredSize | String | Preferred clothing size |
| joinedAt | DateTime | Membership timestamp |

The WhatsApp number is unique to prevent duplicate membership records.

