# 9. Order and Payment Workflow

The current order process is:

```text
Customer visits website
         |
         v
Browses products
         |
         v
Selects size and adds to bag
         |
         v
Reviews cart
         |
         v
Enters customer information
         |
         v
Submits order
         |
         v
POST /api/orders
         |
         v
Order saved in PostgreSQL
         |
         v
Payment status: PAYMENT_ON_HOLD
         |
         v
Owner reviews order in /admin
         |
         v
COD confirmation
         |
         v
Dispatch status update
```

### Current payment implementation

The current checkout is a COD/payment-hold workflow.

There is no verified integration in the current codebase for:

- Razorpay.
- Stripe.
- UPI payment processing.
- Payment gateway webhooks.
- Automatic payment confirmation.

The order submission currently creates an order record; it does not collect or verify payment.

A future developer should implement a proper payment integration if online payments are required.

